3: SQLite export; Lines 156-173: JSONL parsing\n\n#### 2. **cmd/entire/cli/agent/cursor/checkpoint.go** (NEW)\n   - **Purpose**: Hook for Cursor agent to contribute chat archive to checkpoints\n   - **Implementation**:\n     - `ContributeCheckpointFiles(ctx, sessionID, metadataDir)`: Implements `agent.CheckpointContributor` interface\n     - Calls `ExportChatArchive(ctx, sessionID)` and writes to `<metadataDir>/<sessionID>.cursor-chat.json`\n     - File permissions: `0o600`\n   - **Integration Point**: Called by framework during lifecycle SaveStep (see lifecycle.go changes)\n\n#### 3. **cmd/entire/cli/cursor_export.go** (NEW)\n   - **Purpose**: CLI command for ad-hoc Cursor chat export\n   - **Command**: `entire cursor-export <agent-id> [output-path]`\n   - **Behavior**:\n     - Accepts optional output path (defaults to `<agent-id>.cursor-chat.json`)\n     - Reports: database path, meta/blob counts, transcript entry count, final file size\n     - Writes to local filesystem with `0o600` permissions\n   - **Implementation**: ~69 lines, minimal wrapper around `cursor.ExportChatArchive()`\n\n#### 4. **cmd/entire/cli/cursor_import.go** (NEW - 216 lines)\n   - **Purpose**: CLI command to import Cursor chat archives to new machines\n   - **Command**: `entire cursor-import <archive-file> [flags]`\n   - **Flags**:\n     - `--workspace-hash`: Override MD5 hash (default: computed from cwd)\n     - `--project-slug`: Override project directory slug\n     - `--force`: Overwrite existing files without prompting\n   - **Import Logic**:\n     - Validates archive format (`cursor-chat-export`)\n     - Recreates SQLite store.db in `~/.cursor/chats/<workspace-hash>/<agent-id>/store.db`\n     - Recreates JSONL transcript in `~/.cursor/projects/<project-slug>/agent-transcripts/<agent-id>.jsonl`\n     - Creates directories with `0o750` permissions, files with `0o600`\n   - **Key Functions**:\n     - `cursorWorkspaceHash(path)`: MD5 of absolute project path (matching Cursor's convention)\n 