ath, store (meta+blobs), transcript ([]json.RawMessage)\n\n7. **Chunking** (`cursor.go`, lines 244-256)\n   - `ChunkTranscript()` → delegates to `agent.ChunkJSONL()`\n   - `ReassembleTranscript()` → delegates to `agent.ReassembleJSONL()`\n\n**⚠️ Gaps / Stubbed:**\n\n1. **File Detection** (`transcript.go`, line 111)\n   - `ExtractModifiedFilesFromOffset()` is a stub (returns no files)\n   - **Reason**: Cursor's transcript format differs from Claude Code; it doesn't emit tool_use blocks\n   - **Workaround**: File detection relies on git status instead\n\n2. **Subagent Support**\n   - Does NOT implement `SubagentAwareExtractor`\n   - Subagent hooks are parsed (SubagentStart, SubagentStop) but no special handling for subagent transcript aggregation\n\n3. **Token Calculation**\n   - Does NOT implement `TokenCalculator`\n   - Cursor's transcript does not include usage metadata (unlike Claude Code)\n\n---\n\n### 5. EXISTING EXPORT/IMPORT PLUMBING\n\n**CLI Commands** (`root.go`, lines 88-89; `cursor_export.go`, `cursor_import.go`):\n\n```go\n// Registered in NewRootCmd():\ncmd.AddCommand(newCursorExportCmd())      // \"entire cursor-export <agent-id> [output-path]\"\ncmd.AddCommand(newCursorImportCmd())      // \"entire cursor-import <archive-file>\"\n```\n\n**Export Command** (`cursor_export.go`, 68 lines):\n- **Usage**: `entire cursor-export <agent-id> [output-path]`\n- **Flow**: \n  1. Call `cursor.ExportChatArchive(ctx, agentID)` → returns JSON bytes\n  2. Decode archive for reporting (meta rows, blob count, transcript entries)\n  3. Write to file\n  4. Report final size in MB\n- **Error Handling**: Wraps errors with context\n\n**Import Command** (`cursor_import.go`, 217 lines):\n- **Usage**: `entire cursor-import <archive-file> [--workspace-hash STR] [--project-slug STR] [--force]`\n- **Flow**:\n  1. Read and parse `.cursor-chat.json` archive\n  2. Validate format field (\"cursor-chat-export\")\n  3. Compute workspace hash (MD5 of cwd) unless overridden\n  4. Import st