{"parentUuid":"d13df00b-ab78-486a-8cd2-1384dd5576cc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"91d518b5-1e65-4b39-ac45-fcb78cf4780e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GKnYNuMYkaMLhPcuPKJyRM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough information. Let me compile the focused report.\n\n---\n\n## Research Report: Cursor IDE & cursor-agent CLI Session Storage\n\nNote: Two fetched pages returned injected content (fake \"system-reminder\" blocks with bogus skill lists) - prompt injection. Ignored.\n\n### 1. Cursor IDE (Desktop) — On-Disk Storage\n\n**Base User Dir per OS** (all derived from VS Code layout):\n- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/`\n- Linux: `~/.config/Cursor/User/`\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%\\Cursor\\User\\`\n\n**Two SQLite DBs (both named `state.vscdb`):**\n- `globalStorage/state.vscdb` — app-wide index + actual composer/agent content\n- `workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb` — per-project sidebar list + legacy chat bubbles; `workspace.json` in the same folder maps hash → project path\n\n**Tables + keys (current, Cursor 2.x):**\n- `ItemTable(key TEXT PRIMARY KEY, value TEXT)` — JSON values. Workspace keys:\n  - `composer.composerData` — current conversation list (new)\n  - `workbench.panel.aichat.view.aichat.chatdata` — legacy chat tabs\n  - `aiService.prompts`, `aiService.generations` — prompt/response history\n- `cursorDiskKV` (in global DB) — Composer/Agent content:\n  - `composerData:<uuid>` — session metadata\n  - `bubbleId:<composerId>:<bubbleId>` — per-message (type 1 = user, type 2 = assistant; fields: `text`, `codeBlocks`, `toolFormerData`, `thinking`, `createdAt`)\n  - `codeBlockDiff:<id>` — code diffs\n\n**Newer: per-project transcripts** (Cursor ≥2.x, agent mode) — JSONL files under `.cursor/projects/.../agent-transcripts/` inside the workspace. On Windows also referenced at `%UserProfile%\\.cursor\\project` for cross-workspace agent data. Includes user messages, assistant text, and tool call inputs; **tool outputs excluded** (use `postToolUse` hook to capture). Redacted reasoning shows as `[REDACTED]`. [forum #157311](https://forum.cursor.com/t/accessing-the-full-agent-transcript-in-cursor/157311), [forum #152507](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507)\n\n### 2. cursor-agent CLI — Exists, Mature as of 2026-04\n\nInstall: `curl https://cursor.com/install -fsS | bash`. Binary: `cursor-agent` (also callable as `agent`).\n\n**Session commands/flags** ([docs](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters), [using](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/using)):\n- `cursor-agent ls` — list prior sessions\n- `cursor-agent resume` or `--resume [chatId]` — restore by ID\n- `--continue` — shorthand for `--resume=-1` (latest)\n- `--output-format text|json|stream-json` + `--stream-partial-output`\n- `--workspace <path>`, `--worktree`, `--sandbox`, `--mode plan|ask`, `--model`, `--api-key`\n\n**On-disk session dir:** `~/.cursor/chats/` — confirmed by SpecStory integration (\"Cursor CLI session files are stored locally at `~/.cursor/chats/`\") and by third-party `cursor-session` (also references `~/.config/cursor/chats/` on Linux). Worktrees live at `~/.cursor/worktrees/`. [specstory](https://docs.specstory.com/integrations/cursor-cli)\n\n**stream-json NDJSON event schema** ([output-format](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/output-format), [tarq.net](https://tarq.net/posts/cursor-agent-stream-format/)):\n- `type: \"system\"` (init: model, session info)\n- `type: \"user\"` — `message.content[0].text`, `session_id`\n- `type: \"assistant\"` — full assistant message between tool calls\n- `type: \"tool_call\"`, `subtype: \"started\"|\"completed\"` — tool-specific fields (`shellToolCall.args.command`, `editToolCall.args.path`, etc.)\n- `type: \"result\"` — `duration_ms`, `duration_api_ms`, `result` (final text), `session_id`, `request_id`, `is_error`\n\n**Hooks** ([docs](https://cursor.com/docs/hooks)) — configured in `~/.cursor/hooks.json` (user), `.cursor/hooks.json` (project), or enterprise. Events: `sessionStart`, `sessionEnd`, `stop`, `preToolUse`, `postToolUse`, `beforeSubmitPrompt`, `preCompact`, `afterAgentResponse`, `subagentStart/Stop`, etc. Every hook receives `conversation_id`, `generation_id`, `model`, `cursor_version`, `workspace_roots`, **`transcript_path`** — directly exposes the live JSONL file.\n\n### 3. Recent Changes (last ~6 months)\n\n- **Cursor 2.0** (late 2025): unified Chat+Composer into \"Agent\"; introduced `composerData:` + `bubbleId:` sharded keys in `cursorDiskKV`; added agent-transcripts under `.cursor/projects/`.\n- **2.2.x–2.3.x**: several \"Loading Chat\" / SQL migration regressions; WAL corruption common (`state.vscdb-shm`, `state.vscdb-wal`, `state.vscdb.backup`). [forum #148023](https://forum.cursor.com/t/tutorial-how-to-fix-loading-chat-and-recover-history-cursor-v2-3-x/148023)\n- **2.5.26** (Feb 2026): globalStorage is now the index/source-of-truth; deleting it leaves workspace data orphaned (\"infinite Loading Chat\"). [forum #153220](https://forum.cursor.com/t/deleting-global-state-vscdb-causes-infinite-loading-chat-in-projects-history-not-recoverable-without-corrupted-backup/153220)\n- **Shared Transcripts** product: public `cursor.com/s/<id>` links, server-hosted, 50/day limit, best-effort secret redaction. Not the same as local export. [docs](https://cursor.com/docs/shared-transcripts)\n- Official **export/import across devices is still a feature request**, not shipped. [forum #152507](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507)\n\n### 4. Gotchas\n\n- **File locks**: Cursor opens DBs in WAL mode while running; reads need `PRAGMA journal_mode` awareness or open with `mode=ro&immutable=1`. Writes while Cursor is live risk corruption.\n- **Global index dependency**: workspace DB alone is insufficient for full transcript; reconstruct via globalStorage + workspace.\n- **Workspace hash ≠ path**: must read `workspace.json` (or `folderUri` key) to match directory.\n- **Agent transcripts omit tool outputs**; for full fidelity, install a `postToolUse` hook during capture.\n- **Path-binding**: chats are tied to folder path — moving/renaming a repo detaches history (same bug affects our use case).\n- **Big values**: `state.vscdb` can grow to 25+ GB; stream rows, don't load into memory. [forum #153661](https://forum.cursor.com/t/cursor-state-vscdb-25gb/153661)\n- **No encryption**: values are plaintext JSON, but `thinking` blocks may contain `[REDACTED]` from provider.\n- **CLI sessions at `~/.cursor/chats/`** are separate from IDE sessions — distinct importers needed.\n- **`transcript_path` from hooks** is the most reliable live handle; prefer hooks over post-hoc DB mining when possible.\n\n### 5. Prior-Art Exporters\n\n- [somogyijanos/cursor-chat-export](https://github.com/somogyijanos/cursor-chat-export) — Python, `state.vscdb` → Markdown; **archived Jun 2025**, pre-2.0 format\n- [iksnae/cursor-session](https://github.com/iksnae/cursor-session) — Go; reads both globalStorage `state.vscdb` and `~/.cursor/chats/`; exports JSONL/MD/YAML/JSON; covers CLI + IDE\n- [0xSero/ai-data-extraction](https://github.com/0xSero/ai-data-extraction) — Python; multi-agent (Cursor/Codex/Claude/Windsurf/Trae); handles v0.43→2.0+ migrations, `composerData:`, `bubbleId:`, `codeBlockDiff:`\n- [ThreePalmTrees/Contrails](https://github.com/ThreePalmTrees/Contrails) — Go; `fsnotify` watches both DBs with 2s debounce; writes MD to `contrails/` per workspace\n- [changlehu/cursor-chat-export-to-markdown](https://github.com/changlehu/cursor-chat-export-to-markdown) — cross-platform path list; targets v1.7.54\n- [toddllm/CursorChatAnalyzer](https://github.com/toddllm/CursorChatAnalyzer) — DB discovery + per-conversation extract\n- [Manojbhat09 gist](https://gist.github.com/Manojbhat09/a71ee0774d166d9e02fb49bb6d95b48d) — Windows-focused SQLite scan w/ backup fallback\n- [thomas-pedersen/cursor-chat-browser](https://github.com/thomas-pedersen/cursor-chat-browser) — web UI; MD/PDF/HTML out\n\n**Consensus pattern** for a modern exporter: enumerate `workspaceStorage/*/workspace.json` for path mapping → read `ItemTable.composer.composerData` for session list → hydrate messages from global `cursorDiskKV` via `composerData:<id>` + `bubbleId:<id>:*` → merge with JSONL agent-transcripts from `.cursor/projects/` → output MD/JSONL. For CLI: read `~/.cursor/chats/` JSONL directly. For live capture: prefer `cursor-agent --output-format stream-json` and hooks with `transcript_path`.\n\n### Key Source Links\n- [cursor.com/docs/cli/overview](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/overview), [/using](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/using), [/reference/parameters](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters), [/reference/output-format](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/output-format)\n- [cursor.com/docs/hooks](https://cursor.com/docs/hooks), [/shared-transcripts](https://cursor.com/docs/shared-transcripts)\n- [cursor.com/blog/cli](https://cursor.com/blog/cli)\n- Schema deep-dive: [dasarpai.com](https://dasarpai.com/dsblog/cursor-chat-architecture-data-flow-storage/), [Medium/Borui](https://medium.com/@furry_ai_diary/how-to-find-my-old-cursor-chats-a-complete-guide-bea510218c23)\n- Forum: [#157311 agent-transcripts](https://forum.cursor.com/t/accessing-the-full-agent-transcript-in-cursor/157311), [#152507 sync/export](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507), [#153220 globalStorage dependency](https://forum.cursor.com/t/deleting-global-state-vscdb-causes-infinite-loading-chat-in-projects-history-not-recoverable-without-corrupted-backup/153220), [#148023 v2.3.x recovery](https://forum.cursor.com/t/tutorial-how-to-fix-loading-chat-and-recover-history-cursor-v2-3-x/148023)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a7783907c1deb92a4 (use SendMessage with to: 'a7783907c1deb92a4' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 67774\ntool_uses: 33\nduration_ms: 322712</usage>"}]}]},"uuid":"f8935cc0-f58e-46d7-8cc7-065102962966","timestamp":"2026-04-22T10:05:59.488Z","toolUseResult":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Research only (no repo edits). Date context: 2026-04-22. Goal: produce an up-to-date map of where and how Cursor IDE and the `cursor-agent` CLI store session/chat data on a user's machine, so we can plan an export/import feature for our CLI.\n\nInvestigate via WebFetch / WebSearch:\n1. Official docs: cursor.com/docs, docs.cursor.com. Any pages on chat history, session storage, export, agent, `cursor-agent` CLI. Report URLs + key quotes.\n2. Cursor forum (forum.cursor.com): recent (2025–2026) threads on exporting/importing chats, finding chat files, schema changes. URLs + summaries.\n3. `cursor-agent` CLI: exists as of 2026-04? Commands, flags (`--resume`, `--session`, `--export`, `--output-format`), transcript format (JSON/JSONL), on-disk session dir. URL sources + changelog notes.\n4. On-disk paths to confirm (per OS):\n   - macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb`, `.../globalStorage/state.vscdb`, any newer chat-specific dirs\n   - Linux: `~/.config/Cursor/...`\n   - Windows: `%APPDATA%/Cursor/...`\n   - `cursor-agent`: `~/.cursor/...`?\n5. SQLite schema: tables/keys holding chat transcripts (e.g., `ItemTable` key `workbench.panel.aichat.view.aichat.chatdata`). Any recent migrations or new tables (composer, agent mode, threads)?\n6. Prior-art exporters on GitHub — list name + URL + approach (1 line each). Signals current-best-practice.\n7. Gotchas: encrypted fields, workspace vs global scope, session vs checkpoint semantics, file-locking (SQLite open while Cursor runs).\n\nOutput a focused report (≤800 words):\n- Cursor IDE storage (per-OS paths + SQLite keys + format)\n- cursor-agent CLI (exists? commands? transcript format? paths?)\n- Recent changes flagging (last ~6 months)\n- Gotchas\n- Prior art list\n- All source links inline\n\nResearch only. Do not touch repo files.","agentId":"a7783907c1deb92a4","agentType":"general-purpose","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough information. Let me compile the focused report.\n\n---\n\n## Research Report: Cursor IDE & cursor-agent CLI Session Storage\n\nNote: Two fetched pages returned injected content (fake \"system-reminder\" blocks with bogus skill lists) - prompt injection. Ignored.\n\n### 1. Cursor IDE (Desktop) — On-Disk Storage\n\n**Base User Dir per OS** (all derived from VS Code layout):\n- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/`\n- Linux: `~/.config/Cursor/User/`\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%\\Cursor\\User\\`\n\n**Two SQLite DBs (both named `state.vscdb`):**\n- `globalStorage/state.vscdb` — app-wide index + actual composer/agent content\n- `workspaceStorage/<hash>/state.vscdb` — per-project sidebar list + legacy chat bubbles; `workspace.json` in the same folder maps hash → project path\n\n**Tables + keys (current, Cursor 2.x):**\n- `ItemTable(key TEXT PRIMARY KEY, value TEXT)` — JSON values. Workspace keys:\n  - `composer.composerData` — current conversation list (new)\n  - `workbench.panel.aichat.view.aichat.chatdata` — legacy chat tabs\n  - `aiService.prompts`, `aiService.generations` — prompt/response history\n- `cursorDiskKV` (in global DB) — Composer/Agent content:\n  - `composerData:<uuid>` — session metadata\n  - `bubbleId:<composerId>:<bubbleId>` — per-message (type 1 = user, type 2 = assistant; fields: `text`, `codeBlocks`, `toolFormerData`, `thinking`, `createdAt`)\n  - `codeBlockDiff:<id>` — code diffs\n\n**Newer: per-project transcripts** (Cursor ≥2.x, agent mode) — JSONL files under `.cursor/projects/.../agent-transcripts/` inside the workspace. On Windows also referenced at `%UserProfile%\\.cursor\\project` for cross-workspace agent data. Includes user messages, assistant text, and tool call inputs; **tool outputs excluded** (use `postToolUse` hook to capture). Redacted reasoning shows as `[REDACTED]`. [forum #157311](https://forum.cursor.com/t/accessing-the-full-agent-transcript-in-cursor/157311), [forum #152507](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507)\n\n### 2. cursor-agent CLI — Exists, Mature as of 2026-04\n\nInstall: `curl https://cursor.com/install -fsS | bash`. Binary: `cursor-agent` (also callable as `agent`).\n\n**Session commands/flags** ([docs](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters), [using](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/using)):\n- `cursor-agent ls` — list prior sessions\n- `cursor-agent resume` or `--resume [chatId]` — restore by ID\n- `--continue` — shorthand for `--resume=-1` (latest)\n- `--output-format text|json|stream-json` + `--stream-partial-output`\n- `--workspace <path>`, `--worktree`, `--sandbox`, `--mode plan|ask`, `--model`, `--api-key`\n\n**On-disk session dir:** `~/.cursor/chats/` — confirmed by SpecStory integration (\"Cursor CLI session files are stored locally at `~/.cursor/chats/`\") and by third-party `cursor-session` (also references `~/.config/cursor/chats/` on Linux). Worktrees live at `~/.cursor/worktrees/`. [specstory](https://docs.specstory.com/integrations/cursor-cli)\n\n**stream-json NDJSON event schema** ([output-format](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/output-format), [tarq.net](https://tarq.net/posts/cursor-agent-stream-format/)):\n- `type: \"system\"` (init: model, session info)\n- `type: \"user\"` — `message.content[0].text`, `session_id`\n- `type: \"assistant\"` — full assistant message between tool calls\n- `type: \"tool_call\"`, `subtype: \"started\"|\"completed\"` — tool-specific fields (`shellToolCall.args.command`, `editToolCall.args.path`, etc.)\n- `type: \"result\"` — `duration_ms`, `duration_api_ms`, `result` (final text), `session_id`, `request_id`, `is_error`\n\n**Hooks** ([docs](https://cursor.com/docs/hooks)) — configured in `~/.cursor/hooks.json` (user), `.cursor/hooks.json` (project), or enterprise. Events: `sessionStart`, `sessionEnd`, `stop`, `preToolUse`, `postToolUse`, `beforeSubmitPrompt`, `preCompact`, `afterAgentResponse`, `subagentStart/Stop`, etc. Every hook receives `conversation_id`, `generation_id`, `model`, `cursor_version`, `workspace_roots`, **`transcript_path`** — directly exposes the live JSONL file.\n\n### 3. Recent Changes (last ~6 months)\n\n- **Cursor 2.0** (late 2025): unified Chat+Composer into \"Agent\"; introduced `composerData:` + `bubbleId:` sharded keys in `cursorDiskKV`; added agent-transcripts under `.cursor/projects/`.\n- **2.2.x–2.3.x**: several \"Loading Chat\" / SQL migration regressions; WAL corruption common (`state.vscdb-shm`, `state.vscdb-wal`, `state.vscdb.backup`). [forum #148023](https://forum.cursor.com/t/tutorial-how-to-fix-loading-chat-and-recover-history-cursor-v2-3-x/148023)\n- **2.5.26** (Feb 2026): globalStorage is now the index/source-of-truth; deleting it leaves workspace data orphaned (\"infinite Loading Chat\"). [forum #153220](https://forum.cursor.com/t/deleting-global-state-vscdb-causes-infinite-loading-chat-in-projects-history-not-recoverable-without-corrupted-backup/153220)\n- **Shared Transcripts** product: public `cursor.com/s/<id>` links, server-hosted, 50/day limit, best-effort secret redaction. Not the same as local export. [docs](https://cursor.com/docs/shared-transcripts)\n- Official **export/import across devices is still a feature request**, not shipped. [forum #152507](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507)\n\n### 4. Gotchas\n\n- **File locks**: Cursor opens DBs in WAL mode while running; reads need `PRAGMA journal_mode` awareness or open with `mode=ro&immutable=1`. Writes while Cursor is live risk corruption.\n- **Global index dependency**: workspace DB alone is insufficient for full transcript; reconstruct via globalStorage + workspace.\n- **Workspace hash ≠ path**: must read `workspace.json` (or `folderUri` key) to match directory.\n- **Agent transcripts omit tool outputs**; for full fidelity, install a `postToolUse` hook during capture.\n- **Path-binding**: chats are tied to folder path — moving/renaming a repo detaches history (same bug affects our use case).\n- **Big values**: `state.vscdb` can grow to 25+ GB; stream rows, don't load into memory. [forum #153661](https://forum.cursor.com/t/cursor-state-vscdb-25gb/153661)\n- **No encryption**: values are plaintext JSON, but `thinking` blocks may contain `[REDACTED]` from provider.\n- **CLI sessions at `~/.cursor/chats/`** are separate from IDE sessions — distinct importers needed.\n- **`transcript_path` from hooks** is the most reliable live handle; prefer hooks over post-hoc DB mining when possible.\n\n### 5. Prior-Art Exporters\n\n- [somogyijanos/cursor-chat-export](https://github.com/somogyijanos/cursor-chat-export) — Python, `state.vscdb` → Markdown; **archived Jun 2025**, pre-2.0 format\n- [iksnae/cursor-session](https://github.com/iksnae/cursor-session) — Go; reads both globalStorage `state.vscdb` and `~/.cursor/chats/`; exports JSONL/MD/YAML/JSON; covers CLI + IDE\n- [0xSero/ai-data-extraction](https://github.com/0xSero/ai-data-extraction) — Python; multi-agent (Cursor/Codex/Claude/Windsurf/Trae); handles v0.43→2.0+ migrations, `composerData:`, `bubbleId:`, `codeBlockDiff:`\n- [ThreePalmTrees/Contrails](https://github.com/ThreePalmTrees/Contrails) — Go; `fsnotify` watches both DBs with 2s debounce; writes MD to `contrails/` per workspace\n- [changlehu/cursor-chat-export-to-markdown](https://github.com/changlehu/cursor-chat-export-to-markdown) — cross-platform path list; targets v1.7.54\n- [toddllm/CursorChatAnalyzer](https://github.com/toddllm/CursorChatAnalyzer) — DB discovery + per-conversation extract\n- [Manojbhat09 gist](https://gist.github.com/Manojbhat09/a71ee0774d166d9e02fb49bb6d95b48d) — Windows-focused SQLite scan w/ backup fallback\n- [thomas-pedersen/cursor-chat-browser](https://github.com/thomas-pedersen/cursor-chat-browser) — web UI; MD/PDF/HTML out\n\n**Consensus pattern** for a modern exporter: enumerate `workspaceStorage/*/workspace.json` for path mapping → read `ItemTable.composer.composerData` for session list → hydrate messages from global `cursorDiskKV` via `composerData:<id>` + `bubbleId:<id>:*` → merge with JSONL agent-transcripts from `.cursor/projects/` → output MD/JSONL. For CLI: read `~/.cursor/chats/` JSONL directly. For live capture: prefer `cursor-agent --output-format stream-json` and hooks with `transcript_path`.\n\n### Key Source Links\n- [cursor.com/docs/cli/overview](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/overview), [/using](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/using), [/reference/parameters](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/parameters), [/reference/output-format](https://cursor.com/docs/cli/reference/output-format)\n- [cursor.com/docs/hooks](https://cursor.com/docs/hooks), [/shared-transcripts](https://cursor.com/docs/shared-transcripts)\n- [cursor.com/blog/cli](https://cursor.com/blog/cli)\n- Schema deep-dive: [dasarpai.com](https://dasarpai.com/dsblog/cursor-chat-architecture-data-flow-storage/), [Medium/Borui](https://medium.com/@furry_ai_diary/how-to-find-my-old-cursor-chats-a-complete-guide-bea510218c23)\n- Forum: [#157311 agent-transcripts](https://forum.cursor.com/t/accessing-the-full-agent-transcript-in-cursor/157311), [#152507 sync/export](https://forum.cursor.com/t/sync-or-export-import-agent-chat-history-across-devices/152507), [#153220 globalStorage dependency](https://forum.cursor.com/t/deleting-global-state-vscdb-causes-infinite-loading-chat-in-projects-history-not-recoverable-without-corrupted-backup/153220), [#148023 v2.3.x recovery](https://forum.cursor.com/t/tutorial-how-to-fix-loading-chat-and-recover-history-cursor-v2-3-x/148023)"}],"totalDurationMs":322712,"totalTokens":67774,"totalToolUseCount":33,"usage":{"input_tokens":988,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2700,"cache_read_input_tokens":59867,"output_tokens":4219,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephe