tFiles() → Shadow branch → extractExtraFilesFromTree() → WriteCommitted()\nRewind flow:  Checkpoint tree restored → (ExtraFiles left in blob storage, never restored to disk)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. CHECKPOINT READER API — ExtraFiles ENUMERATION\n\n**Available APIs in checkpoint.GitStore:**\n- `ReadCommitted(ctx, checkpointID)` (committed.go:891) — Returns CheckpointSummary with Sessions array, NO ExtraFiles field\n- `ReadSessionContent(ctx, checkpointID, sessionIndex)` (committed.go:969) — Returns SessionContent (transcript/prompts/context), NO ExtraFiles\n- `ListCommitted(ctx)` (committed.go) — List all checkpoints by ID, NO per-checkpoint ExtraFiles\n\n**Directory structure on entire/checkpoints/v1:**\n```\n<checkpoint-id[:2]>/<checkpoint-id[2:]>/\n  ├── metadata.json                    # CheckpointSummary\n  ├── 0/\n  │   ├── metadata.json               # Session 0 metadata\n  │   ├── full.jsonl                  # Transcript\n  │   ├── prompts.jsonl               # Prompts\n  │   └── context.json                # Context\n  ├── 1/ ... (additional sessions)\n  ├── <sessionID>.cursor-chat.json    # ExtraFile: agent-contributed (STORED HERE)\n  ├── tasks/\n  │   └── <tool-use-id>/ ... (task checkpoint metadata)\n  └── <more-extra-files>\n```\n\n**Problem:** ExtraFiles are stored directly under checkpoint root (not under `<index>/`), but there is **NO READ METHOD** to enumerate them.\n\n---\n\n### 5. CHECKPOINTCONTRIBUTOR INTERFACE USAGE\n\n**Interface definition:** `/Users/gtrrz-victor/wks/cli/cursor-export-import-sessions/cmd/entire/cli/agent/agent.go:270-280`\n\n```go\ntype CheckpointContributor interface {\n    Agent\n    ContributeCheckpointFiles(ctx context.Context, sessionID string, metadataDir string) error\n}\n```\n\n**Callsites (only write, no read):**\n1. **lifecycle.go:563-567** — TurnEnd phase calls `ContributeCheckpointFiles()` before SaveStep\n   - Cursor implementation: `agent/cursor/checkpoint.go:12` — writes `<sessionID>.cursor-chat.json`\n   - Non-fa